  "prefLabel": "He-P 4031.02 Terms and Conditions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4031.02 Terms and Conditions. The general license provided in this part shall be subject to the general provisions of He-P 4030.01, 4030.03(b), 4030.10(a), (c), (d), (i) and (j), He-P 4030.15, He-P 4030.16, He-P 4030.17, He-P 4001, He-P 4003, He-P 4019, He-P 4020, He-P 4021, He-P 4022, He-P 4023, and He-P 4037, unless indicated otherwise in the specific provision of the general license.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-P 4031) #6942, eff 2-1-99; ss by #8481, eff 11-5-05; ss by #10604, eff 5-23-14",
